th":"mod-tome.lua","source":"If disabled items with activations will not be auto-added to your hotkeys, you will need to manually drag them from the inventory screen.#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"如果关闭，能使用的物品不会自动添加至快捷栏，你需要手动把它们从物品栏拖到快捷栏。#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7a73c906c6b4818b1240a83265683c92dd9090b859d8e698c98ab86ed584ddc8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9bdbc0637030becf42a661d757be2f50b12c386de0edf0cf6a5fc1b5d6735601","logical_entry_identity":"0326ca5ec1cddbf7b0be33e8d258c225999ecb8a7c05be58df0d5176d3e99069","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Bind","source_tag":"talent name","target":"灵能捆绑"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9cdae34439ba1c8a8c2576d38acfa6d4e0a397333808bb66a8d478373c25a68a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9be05c2a2bf87bf14977e647cc3478f4d8442d1d4c0fee2e6351c0c14161b144","logical_entry_identity":"44f4449cb838665daa73443c78eaaf77bfa1af71659e54a4957dee805602b5ba","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"An alarm rings!","source_tag":"_t","target":"警报响了！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d67d3ba87a6e97d1c652188a26162385e0aa0620767afec46bd0d2f6d53af0e3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9be62f9c39b1747f8b2b001d7c5569be6595ffd682f3a098ee1b479c5a121ddc","logical_entry_identity":"010977446350daf9986827d4f5752fa77270c8eb667ac6bf535fad77d0655279","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Cosmetic Options","source_tag":"_t","target":"外观设置"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"848bf8a79cd8ec8adc06ba08a04d938cb46ca7f7e27b4b0f408039cadcd08d8c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9be701f40d7487baa496ff341bedf58cb4ba2c19763cdd3d2a82b3d4b50453b5","logical_entry_identity":"7c4df3368c338a8a2e1559d355c05c64aced51392eb85a5881702527d44712b3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Channel eldritch forces into a melee attack, hitting the target with your weapon and shield for %d%% arcane damage.\n\t\tIf either attack hits, the target will be stunned for %d turns and you automatically Block.\n\t\tThe chance for the attack to stun increases with your Physical Power, but it is considered a magical attack and thus is resisted with spell save, rather than physical save.\n\t\tDamage increases with Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"调用奥术能量，激发近战攻击，使用武器和盾牌攻击目标造成 %d%% 奥术武器伤害。\n\t\t只要有一次命中，将震慑目标 %d 回合，并且你会进入格挡状态。\n\t\t由于这次攻击视为魔法攻击，震慑成功率由己方物理强度和目标法术豁免（非物理豁免）决定。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d1a695df0f96f6254ac6ee0403fc0a0bc289d2dd7e45cbaa5d2188b645782037","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9be71f3a4aad191a0fbeb3fe85b3f29c3be507ff760eab173de62c1baba77044","logical_entry_identity":"cfacf837707ed1819ba8b5ff71d021392427631e71579f75008118d4b4045168","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#ORCHID#%s does not recognize you.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#ORCHID#%s 没有认出你。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"16bad8b16de93d62f68c8ada1d75c91d4a626e047094bd6bc8951f19ba7ec94d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9be82dd0f351587ecf133c34fb4e40cbc76b0ea02cc918c998d35d599cb9090d","logical_entry_identity":"a5d4fe618a96b9a7f2a121161defee620ab859cf70b60144a361c0cff89da033","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"MINIONS: To my newest vampire: burn, foolish adventurer, burn! I bet you are sorry for that flame spell now, aren't you? Suffer as I revisit it upon you.\n\nTo the rest of you, there will be punishment. An adventurer got down to my bedroom and surprised me. I, Myself, was hurt and almost had to use My special power. All is well now and I am as dangerous as ever, but you shall suffer for letting him get so low. The next minion I see shall be toasted with my marshmallows. Where then were the special pits of doom I organized? Where were the poisons of my wights or the diseases of my ghouls? Indeed, I should slaughter all of you, and I would, but those who were most foully remiss were already slaughtered by the adventurer. The rest of you? Beware My wrath.","source_tag":"_t","target":"奴才们，致吾最新的吸血鬼：燃烧吧，愚蠢的冒险者，燃烧吧！如今汝定然后悔施放那道火焰法术了，是不是？吾将那火焰还施于汝，好好受苦吧。\n\n至于其余奴才，惩罚必不可少。一个冒险者一路闯到吾的寝室，令吾措手不及。吾，吾本人，受了伤，几乎不得不动用吾的特殊力量。如今一切无恙，吾仍像以往一样危险；但汝等放任他深入至此，必将为之受罚。吾接下来见到的仆从，将会和吾的棉花糖一起被烤熟。吾布置的特殊毁灭陷坑当时在哪里？吾的尸妖之毒在哪里？吾的食尸鬼所施疾病又在哪里？吾的确应该把汝等尽数屠杀，而且吾本会如此；可渎职最为严重的那些废物，已经被那冒险者杀掉了。至于剩下的汝等？小心吾之震怒。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8ee099f55633318f0610fd05d18740cad305db382ff6dff86d12a2d220329ffe","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9bea2d1b30c35b75a6e7ef7edf6462011c26affac14645dde71804ecce18fcaf","logical_entry_identity":"84b116cdaa8e9c33a1422d9a203150fedc4d38a5d81e5f26addef694d6df6a63","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Gorbat, Supreme Wyrmic of the Pride","source_tag":"entity name","target":"部落至高龙战士加伯特"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4ceee6f3c06360044f7bd49efc678e0a06616d6928b17d6bc8f4e63e7c1b5394","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9bef62b8017878d823484df918e68952f5ec39d8dab72a7e99a0445f959db78d","logical_entry_identity":"8f842affaf70ed1f70f11d9cf76a16fae1776197e63d914b2112f6d2df56c70c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"alchemist agate","source_tag":"entity name","target":"炼金玛瑙石"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"202d630031576bec84c229fd3cff2bcdbe77a4d4d5e60b08e0bd4a68954c2f83","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9bf3ebb9eb1600ba2bb1130e96caa3c00732517470aa15205442a662e4330f18","logical_entry_identity":"06469aa5b5db889263e4dd6e130baf215c9dc26db37fe0c3f7fe08a2ea6ab238","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Constitution#LAST#\nConstitution defines your character's ability to withstand and resist damage. It increases your maximum life, Physical Save and Healing mod.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#体质#LAST#\n体质属性影响你抵抗和承受伤害的能力，提升体质可以提高你的最大生命值、物理豁免和治疗系数。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"975f47e8e9f8f5caf23c811302d4c4343ee487ffe4b07c421f6b096e39f5a88c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9bf62eea21a00c000d721f502b6fc1eafdee5905755f9e74fe6a68886a087d49","logical_entry_identity":"1e333309e86ff253976952fda94