our armour by %d, your armour hardiness by 20%% and your saves by %d as your natural toughness and reflexes are pushed beyond their normal limits.\n\t\tYour saves armour and defense will improve with your Constitution.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"多亏了你在枯萎能量上的新发现，你学到一些方法来增强你的体质。但是只有当你有一副强壮的体魄时方能承受这剧烈的变化。\n\t\t增加你 500 点生命上限，%d 点闪避，%d 护甲值，20%% 护甲强度 , %d 所有豁免，你的身体已经突破了自然界的范畴和大自然的限制。\n\t\t豁免、护甲和闪避受体质值加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"383dad7471b9148b81c696d655415e0760770dc85c28c31f2d54baf7b099615c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9c85b22944b6ecad4815d6fea21e9d8d66c9c2c58059e5a8a3adf16d19b40fa2","logical_entry_identity":"3d48bb160dd90b4c62f42ba8f6db1bd64d8eb4dabb63490701b00e1b8bdaeed9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Kyless' Journal: First Entry","source_tag":"_t","target":"凯勒斯的日记：第一篇"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"701d913c5b35d1e8c9994ced5878640519fbc0d8f2f1ad6e835594c29774924b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9c8da1df150a543b2571007df195bdbbb15335fa01a20834a92d0109c859dd18","logical_entry_identity":"8caf40dc73b0bc3f8fd2de34dd34676a30f790d831d529ae60fed84069368da7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Bear Trap","source_tag":"_t","target":"捕熊陷阱"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7c1c16be8ea51bd0968ef6034a2ce1458bc39eb6b6c9c7c0cbd18984db57bb27","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9c8f5c9eb404542c8662d04db7fec4fea699f17e014100b03d29efd6b9ba43e8","logical_entry_identity":"d4d920f62271c5b7164f36ffe33eb6f4197c5fafabdd199df8e3d13bd9d64bcb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Manipulate the age of creatures you encounter.","source_tag":"_t","target":"操纵你所遇生物的年龄。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dc5031255c1700808a76140ca87746f5df87d5ade887245bdf3c2eb877063407","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9c8f6275fa489c308207dff473dc116a82f7d6883bcccdaab0c1ceae74741813","logical_entry_identity":"987d8d612339c35b84874e249129d5cf41e8035fa9fb4fb43d3db19179a8457f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your target must be sleeping in order to enter its dreamscape.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"要进入梦境空间，目标必须处于睡眠状态。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c42068a42ed6711b8ef1ebdf8024fd5d09cf0b16ecc4db6d332217e96232cea0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9c8f65513c4dacf15ffd0d671b0fae65cc6f8c23254db2a9c222f27c17a04e47","logical_entry_identity":"6d3b82d7ca6d98b807be388dc65186d090201cf6487e46598531b6801602074c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#WHITE#Shield:","source_tag":"_t","target":"#WHITE#护盾："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f51527cacf1a6b6fef0d3e6e9f507b162693e3e7ac5897876de467492f0aa211","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9c9317239a546fd6b1f1cc33237a2a23089a52a26d3155e97f46dd512c45738a","logical_entry_identity":"079eadeea28d6a206755dcd23fd36b057546dfc73a7aae985a60da8f47d288c0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Nimisil","source_tag":"entity name","target":"尼米希尔"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b1b7f9d2abda7290daae76192d0d5ed7c721706906932efdc1a11294fdc8860a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9c9386b673c2390b42c90ca31d89f94819c5685e5a530e35900fcdf8e864d667","logical_entry_identity":"35d97c2c6951d3cdf15b8bee5c5c5770770251dff889626be28c3ceace35b389","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Infinite x90","source_tag":"achievement name","target":"无尽90层"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"15fe8214465170db861a35bb55a9396d27968f2e5c7e09c5292b65a8cf217e53","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9c96257ecc3e665dd2c17bff8cca5a5851bb09b9d4bba06bd34bd7ee2082667b","logical_entry_identity":"949b121a1f5c57ebcbad1da1d53119167b40a91fc17fc168a5e64cf204a57b1e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"dragon","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"龙"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4af21655061ab526b8d06b9bc431a54fc79c3f53caf815a38e3559d777f46bb5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9c96433fb2bdd2638790d0cd4508a4c4a60ab2d9c6ffee89d3d8b04c9ee7988f","logical_entry_identity":"7202e1ec002189a97276041524093045e25a40ab5703cd0f3c9168e5ae4e7a1a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Cursed","source_tag":"talent type","target":"被诅咒者"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"03791ec9f9d817806c034be19af95b00a8c590ea3517c29df2cac772c3b12c76","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9c9aff9e254dfc991dfe327f47c0f076b0b82d40ff325e38dd2041059fe8d84c","logical_entry_identity":"39d373b1b170291def252a345d6679db6c165720b27f9fa7fecd3906366cf908","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A towering creature, humanoid but huge. It wields a giant maul and does not look friendly.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一只酷似人类却很高大的生物。它手握一个巨锤，看起来不是很友好。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"50e04978c2aa6e14ea9cf3fb497e29f89d0f6decaad1e0d95eee56c6a927ac70","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9c9b74f1a3d21661993721573a088f953b9aef9759c7b4cabe310a9a50ecfba7","logical_entry_identity":"880ffc9eb48fff520b1ec2b6b117e038e9ea06294bc7aaafd8bb1a1b9d827358","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"However, I have been repeatedly told by the powers that be, that I need to get on with this and turn in another report on how a different race got here. So, I will temporarily pause my researches on whether or not Maj'Eyal is real or just an Elf legend. (Can't trust everything they say despite their long memories.) Instead, I am on to meet the keeper of the Eastern Historical Society who has the best collection of lore about how Humans got here. As such, I will be travelling to northern Vor to use their archives.\nAnd yes, unfortunately I will be travelling by adventurer again. By all the gods, why don't I get a better budget? This is absolutely terrible. It has been a particularly long walk. Longer than I thought it would be, truthfully, so I have run out of food. Foolish, I know, but I figured I could ask the escort for some of his. The snobby piece of troll-liver says he doesn't eat! Now talk about a terrible lie. Did he really think that would fool me? This Eastern Historical Society had better be good...","source_tag":"_t","target":"然而，上头已经再三吩咐我赶快推进工作，再交一份有关另一个种族如何来到此地的报告。所以，我要暂时搁置对马基·埃亚尔究竟真实存在、还是仅为精灵传说的研究。（尽管他们记忆久远，说的话却不能全信。）接下来我要去拜会东方历史协会的负责人；协会收藏着有关人类如何来到这里的最佳史料。为此，我将前往沃尔北部查阅他们的档案。\n没错，很不幸，我又得靠冒险者护送了。诸神在上，为什么就不能多给我一点预算？简直糟透了。这一趟步行格外漫长。老实说，路比我预想得远，所以我的食物已经吃光了。我知道这很蠢，可我以为能向护卫讨一点。那个自命不凡的巨魔肝竟然说自己不用吃饭！这谎话也太离谱了。他真以为能骗过我？东方历史协会最好值得我受这些罪……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9b81001e9c68d0bc6770fb5a0b838a5704fd9949f87f8a0a96823cc37239bd32","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9c9e6af68dfc18db4222f1f694d72375a5b27ba545c51766f11b3bb050cc356f","logical_entry_identity":"0d5830a03c9b44f45ba7fafe7abb2c84bbe4b38eb588147e3f89fd721404debb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The humans and the halflings made an alliance to defend their kingdoms, and soon the elves and the dwarves joined too, and we were pushed back. Our tactics became increasingly defensive as they made greater advances into our territory.\n\nWe fought well and hard, but we were not prepared for the terrible tactics they would use. Instead of attacking our military bases they went for our towns and cities, killing all of our civilians. Babes were slaughtered in their mother's arms, and every last woman and child was hunted down and murdered. It was genocide of the highest order.\n\nWhat forces we could muster we sent east, leaving behind token troops who bravely sacrificed themselves against the enemy attacks, convincing them that their genocide had been complete.\n\nBut what was left of our people in the east was a broken picture. Gone were the majority of our women and children, gone were our centres of culture, gone was all softness that ever lived in us. Our military forces were all that were left, consolidated in the Prides. By arcane experimentation we found ways to breed again, but we are left a hollow people. Until we are free from the threats of the other races we can focus on only one thing - revenge.\n\nWe still have a secret presence in the west, in our rightful lands across which we have spilled rivers of our own blood. We are building up our military force at an accelerating rate, and when the time comes we shall sweep across Maj'Eyal with a vengeance that cannot be held back. The other races will suffer as they have made us suffer, and all that they have built will be brought to ruin.","source_tag":"_t","target":"人类与半身人结成了同盟来保卫他们的王国，不久精灵和矮人也加入了进来，我们被迫节节败退。随着他们向我们的领土不断推进，我们的战术变得越来越偏向防守。\n\n我们浴血奋战，但万万没有预料到他们会使出如此卑劣可怖的手段。他们没有进攻我们的军事基地，而是直扑我们的城镇和城市，屠杀了我们所有的平民。婴儿在母亲的怀抱中被屠戮，每一个妇孺都被搜捕并残杀。这是最彻底的种族灭绝。\n\n我们集结了所能调集的所有兵力送往远东，只留下象征性的部队在敌人的攻势前英勇牺牲，好让他们确信种族灭绝已经彻底完成。\n\n但在远东剩下的族人却是一幅支离破碎的景象。绝大多数妇孺已不复存在，我们的文化中心不复存在，我们身上曾有过的一切温情也荡然无存。所幸存的唯有军队，集结在各个兽人部落之中。通过奥术实验，我们找到了重新繁衍的方法，但我们已沦为一个内心空洞的民族。在彻底摆脱其他种族的威胁之前，我们只能专注于一件事——复仇。\n\n我们在西方依然保有一股秘密势力，活动在那片我们曾洒下如河鲜血、理应属于我们的土地上。我们正以更快的速度积聚军事力量，待到时机成熟，我们必将带着势不可挡的复仇怒火横扫马基·埃亚尔。其他种族必将承受我们曾承受过的痛苦，而他们所建立的一切都将被化为废墟。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7cd559d91c0478c31b595b3aee12468a844a52b782d0c603557db7cf07dd47c0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9ca6bd70ace77c8250ae4c947485e1006398986e716b42d65ab8facf96548b47","logical_entry_identity":"724123a360905ab602675773866ae37da0786eb4a71c66697eae7f747330fbdf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"guide","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"梦想家"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"41957e5ba153b7b5f07cfbd4420fa4edd18698cfee4e779c1fadd23759e7f0ff","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9ca7ad8049a54aefc10f00aec46c3fcd65202489e331280f7548d76e8f34a900","logical_entry_identity":"0295e41c90502f40e2757e12d2232cedab1d1f5a46f0c3b48947ce380ae55c67","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You want me to kill mothers and children? This is barbaric, I'll have nothing to do with it!","source_tag":"_t","target":"你让我去杀害母亲和孩子？！这过于残忍了，我绝不接受！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fd91cab8b0a49d5ee109a9966ba0be81aafc12e6fb53cc5bc539c0deef1bdef8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9ca84d6811fc3d9548b71c04df0b704e2510c9b9f8aaaa20af2ea3b9b2f286dc","logical_entry_identity":"a7aa23276d1e42875fb0dad490737ccd97ed0146161f9b7c434e9117b722ce99","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"They can channel the power of the Sun and the Moons to burn and tear apart all who seek to destroy the Sunwall.","source_tag":"_t","target":"他们可以施展太阳、月亮的法术将任何试图破坏太阳堡垒的人消灭。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"41fca7e94df95d3c462b396c05e4c59bb324f7761d463f8c82fb8ecd46422259","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9ca92093bc9e070b939db1143c5607c0a6ef060e02122a9f105952d6a9c8ce43","logical_entry_identity":"e5fe0f40f2d1ab98cd3a6adfeeb3659ec405c90557247cabc65138c8d2d2f374","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"<Press 'x' to swap to advanced display>","source_tag":"_t","target":"<按 X 键切换进阶显示>"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"29ae9cf7613b183a762e7ca2f4b50e641af4abc2efecd5fd2e4ee555e35f7081","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9caad553f13fbdaf7e9d3853835aa13e29660c8ba71e903c5184b0ef20603cab","logical_entry_identity":"0da61367a876e3ce4878d096778d7d95432957828733f52036b4b1612bbf2066","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Toggle Demi-Godmode","source_tag":"_t","target":"切换半神模式"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5d324b4bf3e01545fb8d79c00cb3e661504b14f9b9f0d0691895237c7bc92ba4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9cad0c22c99fc518618272fe4652a3dbc1c3523b325d2d01d8da2dbd648eeca6","logical_entry_identity":"17253dccf4708d2db9b750313fddcff43f483f83bf5b1f1865f65a29202af8a2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"eclipse","source_tag":"talent type","target":"日蚀"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cf373bb979d40eb68952ad6cca210ecca749a66153811e03c80f3e75c5329e06","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9cad16ac15b846f18069b8e9aa913e00e9e58d115e18213f23b7171e26860bfa","logical_entry_identity":"799daaaa79fa2f756e5763907a8874fe3e681c56093289f358e75f094127b931","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{bold}#\nHere lies Eden of Derth\n#{normal}#97 - 121#{italic}#\nUntamed in spirit\nUnhesitant in flight\nUnlifed in grimmest darkness\n#{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{bold}#\n这里安葬着德斯镇的艾登\n#{normal}#97 - 121#{italic}#\n他的灵魂桀骜不驯\n他飞行时毫不犹豫\n但他却未能在最冷酷的黑暗中生存\n#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"afb04d3875252175cd489b9fcdfeb4156a7212ba694e0e9144898ce2d0a6ba74","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9cb0376a79ec3b3e4c849c72444cddb8c6c4c0d4a681e1a3481e4f7481dbc57a","logical_entry_identity":"8e7afacf2b83bdc344a81c65a8f9951fd96548b2793e4ad7d52e3912f613ef22","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is cursed, force all foes in a radius of 5 to attack it.","source_tag":"_t","target":"目标受到诅咒，迫使半径 5 码内的所有敌人攻击它。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1da9f6b69a137e51f4b33933ab0577b8e9f15e8cff954cceb09ebf46867c4a8c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9cb7762e8ad573f87241d7c6cfcdf9787a44717b20d6a3893fe7bf4c15ccb4ae","logical_entry_identity":"fd1ef9522422a38c38d2f99ca3a7e4a0ce658d1e9211eca49e8692e3227e1b99","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Activate the rune to teleport randomly in a range of %d.\n\t\tAfterwards you stay out of phase for %d turns. In this state all new negative status effects duration is reduced by %d%%, your defense is increased by %d and all your resistances by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"激活这个符文会使你在 %d 码范围内随机传送。\n\t\t之后，你会脱离相位 %d 回合，所有新的负面状态持续时间减少 %d%%，闪避增加 %d，全体伤害抗性增加 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3dbdb08866b6b7e16a504fabad850cf26fb3c61c114ad29e206551b07c27719d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9cb7fdca5ee662b55aff8cc4806737719a6e35dea6324ab2a900bae037e98326","logical_entry_identity":"ecf0ff07605903747bdbcf85a702ab045f6ed318e9f115891d4d0a14f2528605","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"nightmare horror","source_tag":"entity name","target":"梦魇恐魔"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"bf27c7e